# StaffIvy Cloud HRIS — Environment Variables
# The app works out-of-the-box with built-in reactive mock data for instant recruiter demos.
# To connect to your real Supabase instance, copy this file to .env.local and fill in your keys:

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

